    rdf:value """Wednesday, June 7, 1916, Grand Hotel, Rome
Motored with same to **San Severa, beyond Cerveteri – a most divine place, and dined again with the same and Placci and MacClure. The latter said England had allowed some very wrong things in regard to the Noli, at first, the Runciman father’s concerns making over 100%!"""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 143 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1916> .

